msgid "Displays a part of a string. The first option is the number of characters to skip from the beginning of the string (Default 0). The second option is the number of characters to return (Default: until end of string). The third option is the string to append and/or prepend when truncation occurs (Default: \"…\")."
msgstr "Only shows part of a string. First option is an offset to define where the output of your text starts (Default 0). Second option is an offset how much text is returned. If empty, returns all the remaining text. The third option defines which chars will be appended to the output when a substring is returned (Default: …) ."

msgid "Displays an image and a link; the column contains the filename. The first option is a URL prefix like \"https://www.example.com/\". The second and third options are the width and the height in pixels."
msgstr "Bir rəsm və link göstərir, sütun fayl adını özündə ehtiva edir; ilk seçim \"https://domain.com/\" kimi URL prefiksidir, ikinci və üçüncü seçim isə piksel olaraq eni və hündürlüyü göstərir."

